OL,3,GNEWSAJewellery worth #29K stolen 'in
OL,4,Atwo minutes'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who stole more than #29,000 worth
OL,7,Fof items in just two minutes from a
OL,8,Fjewellers before going on to raid other
OL,9,Fshops has been jailed.
OL,11,FJoe Ross, 36, of Manor Close, Little
OL,12,FWilbraham, near Cambridge, smashed his
OL,13,Fway inside Chloe's Jewellers in St Ives
OL,14,Fusing a hammer at 03:30 BST on 30
OL,15,FApril, before breaking into and
OL,16,Fstealing #450 from Stow-Cum-Quy post
OL,17,Foffice 24 hours later.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,375,370,200,160,0,100
