OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAJewellery worth #29K stolen 'in
OL,4,Atwo minutes'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA few hours later, he stole jars of
OL,7,Fcoffee from Burwell Co-op and then on 3
OL,8,FMay he attempted - but failed - to
OL,9,Fbreak into another post office in the
OL,10,Fvillage.
OL,12,FAt Peterborough Crown Court on
OL,13,FWednesday he was sentenced to 16 months
OL,14,Fin prison after pleading guilty to the
OL,15,Foffences.
